/// (pass `HOME` pointing at a temp home so the CLI never reads the
/// developer's real `~/.fah`). `OPENAI_API_KEY` is pinned to `mock` unless
/// overridden. Throws [TimeoutException] past [timeout].
Future<FaResult> runFaHeadless({

